plzig-zig-toolchain: notices
============================

This package contains the official Zig compiler release built by the Zig
Software Foundation (https://ziglang.org/download/), version and SHA-256
pinned by PL/Zig, repackaged for PL/Zig: the compiler binary unchanged, and
a pruned copy of its lib/ directory (lib/std, lib/compiler_rt, lib/compiler,
lib/c and the top-level files of lib/, unchanged). Everything else of the
upstream tarball is left out, in particular the C/C++ library sources and
headers in lib/libc, lib/include, lib/libcxx, lib/libcxxabi, lib/libunwind
and lib/libtsan, which carry other licenses (LGPL, GPL with the Linux
syscall note, APSL, ...) and are not needed by PL/Zig.

It is installed in a private directory and is meant only for PL/Zig
(plzig.zig_path); it does not put `zig` on the PATH.

PL/Zig is an independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Zig Software Foundation.


