Components statically linked into the zig binary
------------------------------------------------
The official Linux builds are statically linked. Identified from the
binary and from the zig-bootstrap project's component list:

* LLVM, Clang, LLD and LLVM's libc++, libc++abi and libunwind
  (the binary reports clang version 22.1.8).
  License: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; parts under the legacy LLVM
  license (University of Illinois/NCSA).
  Text: licenses/LLVM-LICENSE.TXT (llvm/LICENSE.TXT of llvmorg-22.1.8).

* zlib 1.3.1. License: Zlib. Text: licenses/zlib-LICENSE.txt.

* Zstandard (zstd). License: BSD-3-Clause (zstd is dual-licensed
  BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-only; distributed here under BSD-3-Clause).
  Text: licenses/zstd-LICENSE.txt.

* musl libc (static C library of the binary). License: MIT.
  Text: licenses/musl-COPYRIGHT.txt.

